        },
        {
          "event_type": "nothing",
          "message": "[bold]You arrive at Pearl Shallows.[/bold]\n\nThe port welcomes you with color — indigo cloth, golden cotton, the red earth that stains everything it touches. Arrivals on the Gold Coast feel like being invited to a celebration you didn't know was happening.\n\nCanoes glide in from the reef. Divers emerge glistening, pouches of pearls tied to their wrists. An elder sits under a baobab tree, examining each pearl by sunlight.\n\n[bold]Harbor Keeper Nana:[/bold] She holds up a slate: 'ANCHOR HERE. NOWHERE ELSE. CORAL BELOW.' Then a smaller note: 'Welcome.'\n\n[dim]Landmark: The Blessing Pool — a tidal pool where divers pray before descending.[/dim]\n[dim]Custom: Pearls are never haggled over. The diver names the price. You pay or you leave.[/dim]",
          "hull_delta": 0,
          "provision_delta": 0,
          "silver_delta": 0,
          "crew_delta": 0,
          "speed_modifier": 1.0,
          "cargo_lost": [],
          "flavor": "[arrival]"
